      "side": 1,
      "message": "This patch will alter the sequence of the following events:\n\n**Before:**\n1. `sched_switch`\n2. `sched_waking`\n3. `sched_blocked_reason`\n4. `sched_wakeup`\n\nor\n\n1. `sched_waking`\n2. `sched_blocked_reason`\n3. `sched_switch`\n4. `sched_wakeup`\n\n**After:**\n1. `sched_switch`\n2. `sched_blocked_reason`\n3. `sched_waking`\n4. `sched_wakeup`\n\nor\n\n1. `sched_waking`\n2. `sched_switch`\n3. `sched_blocked_reason`\n4. `sched_wakeup`\n\nI am unsure whether this will affect Perfetto\u0027s parser, so it is necessary for Perfetto experts to review it.",
      "revId": "1e3c05e7f2797947f6aed5f2c4ac5d355e8872a4",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
