      "writtenOn": "2025-01-14T02:35:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This could definitely affect our parsing logic and I\u0027m quite concerned about this change as sched_blocked_reason is a load bearing event that a lot of people care about.\n\nCould you please provide a more detailed example with the fields of each event? It\u0027s not clear to me by just the event names whether the thread the sched_blocked_reason event is being emitted for is switching in or out.\n\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/android14-qpr3-release:external/perfetto/src/trace_processor/importers/common/thread_state_tracker.cc contains the logic for us parsing schedblockreason.",
      "parentUuid": "ef04bf04_83177052",
      "revId": "1e3c05e7f2797947f6aed5f2c4ac5d355e8872a4",
